{
  "description": "MakemkvService.invocation (MakemkvSetup, plan §11.1, session A 2026-10-15): what one makemkvcon run gets. Given: config (the job's configuration document, through ConfigCodec.decode); configId (the drive entry; the profile is ProfileResolver.resolve(config, configId, no facts, no session)); selectionOverride; jobDirectory (default /data/jobs/j1); the service's dataDir (default /home/u/.MakeMKV), home (/home/u) and user settings file (<dataDir>/settings.conf; userSettings is its text, absent: no such file, null: the service has none, as on Windows; userSettingsFails {code, params}: reading it fails so); the real ConfigService behind it, with a system keystore holding secrets {name: value} (keystoreFails {name: {code, params}}: that secret's get fails so), an empty secrets folder and the BROMELIA_SECRET_* environment. Expect: settings (the run's settings.conf, exactly), profileXml (null, or {name, selection}: the generated profile's <name> and app_DefaultSelectionString), options {profilePath, minLengthSeconds, cacheMB, directIO, extraArguments, scan}, workDirectory, dataDir, stallTimeout (seconds; null: none), transcript; or error {code, params} (the call fails).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "nothing-configured",
      "from": [
        "rearchitecture-plan §11.1 MakemkvService; windows Bromelia.Core MakeMKVEnvironment.Prepare"
      ],
      "given": {
        "config": {
          "version": 3
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "settings": {
          "app_DataDir": "/home/u/.MakeMKV"
        },
        "profileXml": null,
        "options": {
          "profilePath": null,
          "minLengthSeconds": null,
          "cacheMB": null,
          "directIO": null,
          "extraArguments": "",
          "scan": false
        },
        "workDirectory": "/data/jobs/j1/home",
        "dataDir": "/home/u/.MakeMKV",
        "stallTimeout": 1800,
        "transcript": "/data/jobs/j1/makemkv.txt"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "global-then-profile-then-drive-settings",
      "from": [
        "windows AppConfig.EffectiveSettings; config-3.json makemkv.settings, profiles[].makemkv.settings, drives[].makemkvSettings"
      ],
      "given": {
        "config": {
          "version": 3,
          "profiles": [
            {
              "id": "default",
              "name": "Default",
              "makemkv": {
                "settings": {
                  "dvd_MinimumTitleLength": "30",
                  "io_ErrorRetryCount": "2"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "drives": [
            {
              "id": "left",
              "match": {
                "driveName": "BD-RE LEFT 1.00"
              },
              "makemkvSettings": {
                "io_ErrorRetryCount": "5"
              }
            }
          ],
          "makemkv": {
            "settings": {
              "dvd_MinimumTitleLength": "120",
              "app_Proxy": "",
              "app_ccextractor": "/opt/cc"
            }
          }
        },
        "configId": "left"
      },
      "expect": {
        "settings": {
          "app_ccextractor": "/opt/cc",
          "dvd_MinimumTitleLength": "30",
          "io_ErrorRetryCount": "5",
          "app_DataDir": "/home/u/.MakeMKV"
        },
        "profileXml": null,
        "options": {
          "profilePath": null,
          "minLengthSeconds": null,
          "cacheMB": null,
          "directIO": null,
          "extraArguments": "",
          "scan": false
        },
        "workDirectory": "/data/jobs/j1/home",
        "dataDir": "/home/u/.MakeMKV",
        "stallTimeout": 1800,
        "transcript": "/data/jobs/j1/makemkv.txt"
      }
    },
